---
import { localePath, type Locale } from '../../i18n';
import ExternalBrandMark from '../common/ExternalBrandMark';

interface Props { locale: Locale }
const { locale } = Astro.props;
const zh = locale === 'zh';
const t = (cn: string, en: string) => zh ? cn : en;
const p = (path: string) => localePath(locale, path);

const resultsHref = p('/research/seed-openevo/study/results/');
const ceilingHref = p('/research/seed-openevo/study/capability-exploration/stage2-ceiling/');
const gdrHref = p('/research/seed-openevo/study/capability-exploration/gdr-directapply/');
const flowHref = p('/research/seed-openevo/flow/');
const q17Pr = 'https://github.com/mykcs/openevo-experiment/pull/378';
const q17Successor = 'https://github.com/mykcs/openevo-experiment/pull/379';
const determinismIssue = 'https://github.com/mykcs/OpenEvo/issues/13';
---

<article class="briefing" data-ui-audit="surface" data-testid="progress-briefing">
  <section id="briefing-top" class="briefing-slide briefing-cover" data-briefing-primary aria-labelledby="briefing-title">
    <div class="slide-inner">
      <p class="slide-meta"><time datetime="2026-09-08">2026-09-08</time> · {t('研究组阶段汇报', 'Lab progress briefing')}</p>
      <h1 id="briefing-title">{t('SEED × OpenEVO 项目阶段汇报', 'SEED × OpenEVO project progress')}</h1>
      <p class="cover-thesis">{t(
        '7B 学习链已经完整跑通。现在的核心是让结果可信、变量可单独归因；Q17 因固定 GPU 下 SD-LoRA 仍不确定，继续保持暂停。',
        'The 7B learning chain now runs end to end. The priority is trustworthy, single-variable attribution; Q17 remains paused because SD-LoRA still diverges on a fixed GPU.'
      )}</p>
      <dl class="cover-status" aria-label={t('当前阶段状态', 'Current project state')}>
        <div><dt>{t('已经做到', 'Completed')}</dt><dd>{t('7B 持续学习完整收口到 128 题最终测试', 'A full 7B continual-learning run closed out on a 128-task final panel')}</dd></div>
        <div><dt>{t('正在解决', 'Resolving now')}</dt><dd>{t('Q17 的固定 GPU SD-LoRA 确定性问题', 'Fixed-GPU SD-LoRA determinism for Q17')}</dd></div>
        <div><dt>{t('主比较状态', 'Main comparison')}</dt><dd>{t('OpenEVO vs SEED 的同口径最终比较还没完成', 'The same-protocol OpenEVO-vs-SEED final comparison is still pending')}</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="question" class="briefing-slide" aria-labelledby="question-title">
    <div class="slide-inner">
      <p class="slide-number">01 / 10</p>
      <h2 id="question-title">{t('研究问题', 'Research question')}</h2>
      <p class="slide-thesis">{t(
        '我们真正要回答的是：在可比的 WebShop 任务预算下，OpenEVO 学习以后，能不能在没参与训练的任务上稳定变好？如果变了，变化来自哪里？',
        'The question is whether OpenEVO learning reliably improves unseen-task performance under a comparable WebShop task budget, and what causes any change we observe.'
      )}</p>
      <ol class="question-list">
        <li><span>Q1</span><div><strong>{t('最终效果', 'Final effect')}</strong><p>{t('同任务、同评测规则、匹配预算下比较 OpenEVO 与基线 / SEED。', 'Compare OpenEVO with baseline / SEED under the same tasks, evaluation rules, and matched budget.')}</p></div></li>
        <li><span>Q2</span><div><strong>{t('学习来源', 'Learning source')}</strong><p>{t('拆开基础模型、初始经验、MiniMax 任务后回看等因素，不把“老师、模型大小、训练路径”混成一个变量。', 'Separate base-model scale, initial experience, and MiniMax post-task hindsight instead of mixing teacher, model size, and training path into one variable.')}</p></div></li>
        <li><span>Q3</span><div><strong>{t('更新机制', 'Update mechanism')}</strong><p>{t('判断 GDR 的更新筛选是在保护长期学习，还是把短期看起来变差但长期有用的更新挡掉。', 'Test whether GDR protects long-horizon learning or rejects updates that look worse locally but could help later.')}</p></div></li>
      </ol>
      <aside class="evidence-strip">
        <strong>{t('预算先钉死', 'Pin the budget first')}</strong>
        <p>{t('SEED 论文：Stage 1 = 1,440 条轨迹；RL = 150 次 policy update × batch 16 × rollout group 8 = 19,200 条轨迹，总计 20,640。公开 WebShop launcher 另有 160 epoch 路径，两种来源不能写成同一个“SEED 预算”。', 'SEED paper: Stage 1 = 1,440 trajectories; RL = 150 policy updates × batch 16 × rollout group 8 = 19,200 trajectories, for 20,640 total. The public WebShop launcher separately has a 160-epoch path; these provenances cannot be collapsed into one “SEED budget.”')}</p>
      </aside>
      <footer class="slide-footer"><span>{t('主问题先定义可比性，再谈输赢。', 'Comparability comes before declaring a winner.')}</span><a href="#route">{t('下一页：探索路线 ↓', 'Next: exploration ↓')}</a></footer>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="route" class="briefing-slide" aria-labelledby="route-title">
    <div class="slide-inner">
      <p class="slide-number">02 / 10</p>
      <h2 id="route-title">{t('探索路线', 'Exploration path')}</h2>
      <p class="slide-thesis">{t('路线不是一开始就定好的。每一轮都先把失败拆成“测量问题、模型问题、学习问题、机制问题”，然后让下一轮实验只回答其中一个。', 'The route was not fixed in advance. Each round decomposed failures into measurement, model, learning, and mechanism questions, then narrowed the next experiment to one of them.')}</p>
      <ol class="timeline">
        <li><span>A</span><div><strong>{t('先修测量', 'Repair measurement first')}</strong><p>{t('复现 SEED / WebShop 时发现 action wrapper 与 parser 会把可执行行为误判成失败，于是先做 source-faithful 语义核对。', 'SEED / WebShop reproduction exposed action-wrapper and parser mismatches that could turn executable behavior into false failure, so source-faithful semantic validation came first.')}</p></div></li>
        <li><span>B</span><div><strong>{t('再拆模型与教师', 'Separate model and teacher effects')}</strong><p>{t('用 3B / 7B × self / MiniMax 做历史四臂探索；MiniMax 只在任务结束后看轨迹，不替学生点击网页。', 'Historical 3B / 7B × self / MiniMax arms explored scale and hindsight; MiniMax reviews completed trajectories and never acts in WebShop for the student.')}</p></div></li>
        <li><span>C</span><div><strong>{t('把学习链跑到底', 'Run the learning chain to completion')}</strong><p>{t('7B Ceiling 从短批次诊断推进到 149 个完整 round，再锁死最终 128 题做 closeout。', 'The 7B Ceiling moved beyond short-batch diagnostics: 149 complete rounds followed by closeout on a locked 128-task final panel.')}</p></div></li>
        <li><span>D</span><div><strong>{t('最后拆机制', 'Finally isolate the mechanism')}</strong><p>{t('发现 GDR 会改变“候选更新是否真正进入模型”后，建立 GDR vs DirectApply 双胞胎实验，只允许 transition authority 不同。', 'Once GDR was shown to control whether candidates actually enter the model, a GDR-vs-DirectApply twin was designed with transition authority as the only intended treatment.')}</p></div></li>
      </ol>
      <footer class="slide-footer"><span>{t('每个失败都变成下一轮更窄的问题。', 'Every failure becomes a narrower next question.')}</span><a href="#system">{t('下一页：实验系统 ↓', 'Next: system ↓')}</a></footer>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="system" class="briefing-slide" aria-labelledby="system-title">
    <div class="slide-inner">
      <p class="slide-number">03 / 10</p>
      <h2 id="system-title">{t('实验系统', 'Experimental system')}</h2>
      <p class="slide-thesis">{t('现在不是“跑一个训练脚本”，而是在控制一条完整证据链：任务怎样抽、模型看到了什么、谁做复盘、哪次参数更新被接受，以及最终测试什么时候才能解锁。', 'This is no longer “running a training script.” We control a full evidence chain: task sampling, model inputs, who performs hindsight, which update is retained, and when final evaluation may be unlocked.')}</p>
      <figure class="pipeline" aria-labelledby="pipeline-caption">
        <div class="pipeline-row">
          <div><span>01</span><strong>{t('冻结任务 / seed', 'Frozen tasks / seed')}</strong></div><i aria-hidden="true">→</i>
          <div><span>02</span><strong>Qwen rollout</strong></div><i aria-hidden="true">→</i>
          <div><span>03</span><strong>{t('封存 trajectory', 'Sealed trajectory')}</strong></div><i aria-hidden="true">→</i>
          <div><span>04</span><strong>{t('回看与训练信号', 'Hindsight / signal')}</strong></div><i aria-hidden="true">→</i>
          <div><span>05</span><strong>SD-LoRA candidate</strong></div><i aria-hidden="true">→</i>
          <div><span>06</span><strong>GDR / DirectApply</strong></div><i aria-hidden="true">→</i>
          <div><span>07</span><strong>{t('保留模型', 'Retained state')}</strong></div>
        </div>
        <figcaption id="pipeline-caption">{t('最终 128 题在训练完成前保持锁定，不允许用来挑规则、挑 checkpoint 或做试跑。', 'The final 128-task panel stays locked until training is complete; it cannot be used to choose rules, checkpoints, or smoke-test variants.')}</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <dl class="system-notes">
        <div><dt>MiniMax</dt><dd>{t('只在已封存的任务轨迹之后做回看分析，不负责 WebShop 搜索或点击。', 'Reviews sealed trajectories only; it does not search or click in WebShop.')}</dd></div>
        <div><dt>{t('Q17 GPU 设计', 'Q17 GPU design')}</dt><dd>{t('rollout 可以使用 8-GPU pool；SD-LoRA 候选训练必须固定到同一块物理 GPU，避免把硬件差异混进 treatment。', 'Rollouts may use an 8-GPU pool; SD-LoRA candidate training must be pinned to the same physical GPU so hardware variation cannot leak into the treatment.')}</dd></div>
        <div><dt>{t('状态身份', 'State identity')}</dt><dd>{t('任务 manifest、source SHA、candidate hash、receipt 和 final panel 都有独立身份；历史证据与当前 authority 分开。', 'Task manifests, source SHAs, candidate hashes, receipts, and the final panel have separate identities; historical evidence stays distinct from current authority.')}</dd></div>
      </dl>
      <footer class="slide-footer"><span>{t('输入、处理、输出都要可追溯。', 'Inputs, transformations, and outputs must all be traceable.')}</span><a href="#measurement">{t('下一页：测量修复 ↓', 'Next: measurement ↓')}</a></footer>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="measurement" class="briefing-slide" aria-labelledby="measurement-title">
    <div class="slide-inner">
      <p class="slide-number">04 / 10</p>
      <h2 id="measurement-title">{t('测量修复', 'Measurement repair')}</h2>
      <p class="slide-thesis">{t('第一个关键教训是：0 分不一定代表模型什么都不会。如果测试接口没有正确接住模型动作，这个 0 分首先是测量无效。', 'The first major lesson was that a zero score does not necessarily mean zero capability. If the evaluation wrapper fails to carry the model action correctly, the measurement itself is invalid.')}</p>
      <div class="before-after">
        <div><span>{t('最初', 'Before')}</span><strong>{t('动作包装 / parser 不兼容', 'Action-wrapper / parser mismatch')}</strong><p>{t('PRIMARY-v1 的 0/0 结果被判为 measurement-invalid，不能解释成模型能力为 0。', 'PRIMARY-v1’s 0/0 result was classified measurement-invalid and cannot be interpreted as zero model capability.')}</p></div>
        <i aria-hidden="true">→</i>
        <div><span>{t('修复后', 'After')}</span><strong>128 / 128 semantic PASS</strong><p>{t('source-faithful panel 的运行时语义逐格核对通过，parser-invalid = 0。', 'The source-faithful panel passed runtime semantic validation cell by cell, with parser-invalid = 0.')}</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="table-wrap" tabindex="0" aria-label={t('7B 同任务配对测量', 'Paired 7B same-task measurement')}>
        <table>
          <thead><tr><th>{t('同一批 128 个任务', 'Same 128 tasks')}</th><th>Task Score ×100</th><th>{t('完整成功', 'Exact success')}</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody><tr><th scope="row">{t('7B · 基础模型', '7B · base model')}</th><td>7.17</td><td>5 / 128</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">{t('7B · 冻结 OpenEVO SD-LoRA', '7B · frozen OpenEVO SD-LoRA')}</th><td>8.74</td><td>5 / 128</td></tr></tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p class="stat-line"><strong>Δ = +1.57</strong><span>95% CI = [−3.21, +6.31]</span><span>{t('方向为正，但区间跨过 0 → 不能宣称稳定提升', 'Positive direction, but the interval crosses 0 → no stable-improvement claim')}</span></p>
      <footer class="slide-footer"><a href={resultsHref}>{t('查看结果证据 ↗', 'Open result evidence ↗')}</a><a href="#ceiling">{t('下一页：7B 结果 ↓', 'Next: 7B result ↓')}</a></footer>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="ceiling" class="briefing-slide" aria-labelledby="ceiling-title">
    <div class="slide-inner">
      <p class="slide-number">05 / 10</p>
      <h2 id="ceiling-title">{t('7B 持续学习结果', '7B continual-learning result')}</h2>
      <p class="slide-thesis">{t('随后我们把一条 7B 学习链真正跑到底：不是只证明“能生成 LoRA”，而是持续产生并保留参数变化，最后对锁定的 128 个任务做完整测试。', 'We then ran one 7B learning chain all the way through: not merely generating LoRA candidates, but retaining parameter changes over time and completing evaluation on the locked 128 tasks.')}</p>
      <dl class="metric-line">
        <div><dt>{t('完整学习轮', 'Completed rounds')}</dt><dd>149</dd><small>round 0–148</small></div>
        <div><dt>{t('计入实验的任务', 'Accepted rollouts')}</dt><dd>19,072</dd><small>{t('partial round 149 不混入', 'partial round 149 excluded')}</small></div>
        <div><dt>SD-LoRA</dt><dd>143</dd><small>{t('保留的 components', 'retained components')}</small></div>
        <div><dt>{t('最终 Task Score', 'Final Task Score')}</dt><dd>49.33</dd><small>/ 100</small></div>
        <div><dt>{t('完整成功', 'Exact success')}</dt><dd>58 / 128</dd><small>45.31%</small></div>
      </dl>
      <aside class="evidence-strip evidence-positive"><strong>{t('这个结果真正证明什么', 'What this result actually proves')}</strong><p>{t('学习链能够长时间运行、产生真实参数状态，并在独立 final panel 上形成可封存结果。7 个 action-admissibility fail-closed 样本仍保留在 128 题分母里，runtime errors = 0。', 'The learning chain can run for a long horizon, produce real parameter states, and close out on an independent final panel. Seven fail-closed action-admissibility cases remain in the 128-task denominator; runtime errors = 0.')}</p></aside>
      <p class="claim-boundary"><strong>{t('它还不能证明：', 'It still does not prove:')}</strong> {t('OpenEVO 相对 SEED 的因果优势。89.7 是 SEED 论文参考数字，不是这条 7B run 的本地配对对照。', 'a causal advantage of OpenEVO over SEED. The SEED paper’s 89.7 is an external reference, not a locally paired control for this 7B run.')}</p>
      <footer class="slide-footer"><a href={ceilingHref}>{t('查看 7B Ceiling 完整结果 ↗', 'Open full 7B Ceiling result ↗')}</a><a href="#twin">{t('下一页：机制对照 ↓', 'Next: mechanism twin ↓')}</a></footer>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="twin" class="briefing-slide" aria-labelledby="twin-title">
    <div class="slide-inner">
      <p class="slide-number">06 / 10</p>
      <h2 id="twin-title">GDR 与 DirectApply</h2>
      <p class="slide-thesis">{t('7B 跑通以后，问题变成“为什么学成这样”。GDR 会决定一个已经训练好的候选更新能不能真正进入下一轮；所以我们设计双胞胎实验，只改这一件事。', 'Once the 7B chain worked, the question became “why did learning behave this way?” GDR decides whether a trained candidate may enter the next state, so the twin changes only that transition authority.')}</p>
      <div class="twin-design">
        <div><span>ARM A</span><strong>GDR_GATE</strong><p>{t('候选更新可以被 veto；只有通过 gate 才应用。', 'A candidate can be vetoed; only gate-passing candidates are applied.')}</p></div>
        <div class="same-core"><span>{t('两边固定相同', 'Held identical')}</span><ul><li>common state0</li><li>{t('任务 / seed / sampling', 'tasks / seeds / sampling')}</li><li>160 rounds × 128 rollouts</li><li>candidate opportunity / shadow probe</li><li>{t('新鲜且锁定的 128-task final', 'fresh locked 128-task final')}</li></ul></div>
        <div><span>ARM B</span><strong>DIRECT_APPLY</strong><p>{t('只要候选满足共同 eligibility，就直接进入下一轮，不经过 GDR veto。', 'Any candidate meeting shared eligibility enters the next state without the GDR veto.')}</p></div>
      </div>
      <p class="claim-boundary"><strong>{t('统计边界：', 'Statistical boundary:')}</strong> {t('一对 exact-seed twin 只能作为探索性证据；要升级成算法层主张，预注册要求至少 3 个训练 seed。', 'One exact-seed twin is exploratory evidence only; an algorithm-level claim is preregistered to require at least three training seeds.')}</p>
      <footer class="slide-footer"><a href={gdrHref}>{t('查看 GDR → DirectApply 说明 ↗', 'Open GDR → DirectApply explainer ↗')}</a><a href="#blocker">{t('下一页：当前阻塞 ↓', 'Next: blocker ↓')}</a></footer>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="blocker" class="briefing-slide" aria-labelledby="blocker-title">
    <div class="slide-inner">
      <p class="slide-number">07 / 10</p>
      <h2 id="blocker-title">{t('Q17 当前阻塞', 'Current Q17 blocker')}</h2>
      <p class="slide-thesis">{t('Round 0 刚做完，我们就发现：两组虽然在 treatment 之前做了完全一样的 128 次任务，但训练出来的 SD-LoRA 候选权重已经不同。此时继续跑，后面的差异就不能只归因于 GDR。', 'Immediately after Round 0, we found that the two arms had executed exactly the same 128 pre-treatment tasks, yet their trained SD-LoRA candidate weights were already different. Continuing would make later differences impossible to attribute solely to GDR.')}</p>
      <div class="blocker-proof">
        <dl>
          <div><dt>rollout parity</dt><dd><code>attempts.jsonl</code> · 128 / 128 {t('逐字节一致', 'byte-identical')}</dd></div>
          <div><dt>{t('训练内容', 'Training content')}</dt><dd>{t('prompt / response / reward / task / trace 相同；persisted replay payload 相同', 'prompt / response / reward / task / trace identical; persisted replay payload identical')}</dd></div>
          <div><dt>{t('随机性', 'Randomness')}</dt><dd>{t('相同 seed；重复到同一物理 GPU 仍出现不同权重', 'same seed; repeated training on the same physical GPU still diverges')}</dd></div>
          <div><dt>{t('结果', 'Result')}</dt><dd><strong>PAUSED</strong> · {t('Round 1 禁止继续', 'Round 1 remains forbidden')}</dd></div>
        </dl>
        <div class="digest-pair">
          <p><span>GDR</span><code>108960ca15ea1142b6f42e4d1fd29c65407841da00eb72c182fc4a61c7b361de</code></p>
          <p><span>DirectApply</span><code>5f5fe2f855728981cc2e305f26d636e96a05f276bc1d29f059b007a2d43d0326</code></p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <aside class="evidence-strip evidence-warning"><strong>{t('恢复前的确定性 gate', 'Determinism gate before resuming')}</strong><p>{t('同 payload + 同 seed + 同一块指定物理 GPU，独立重复至少 2 次，必须得到相同 adapter SHA256、serialized SD state hash、training loss；不支持的非确定性算子必须 fail closed。通过后还需要新的、明确的 scientific resume authority。', 'Same payload + same seed + the same designated physical GPU, repeated independently at least twice, must produce identical adapter SHA256, serialized SD-state hashes, and training loss. Unsupported nondeterministic operators must fail closed. A new explicit scientific resume authority is still required afterward.')}</p></aside>
      <footer class="slide-footer"><span class="source-links"><a href={q17Pr} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><ExternalBrandMark href={q17Pr} />Q17 PR #378 ↗</a><a href={determinismIssue} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><ExternalBrandMark href={determinismIssue} />OpenEvo issue #13 ↗</a></span><a href="#quality">{t('下一页：质量体系 ↓', 'Next: quality ↓')}</a></footer>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="quality" class="briefing-slide" aria-labelledby="quality-title">
    <div class="slide-inner">
      <p class="slide-number">08 / 10</p>
      <h2 id="quality-title">{t('质量体系', 'Quality system')}</h2>
      <p class="slide-thesis">{t('我们把实验质量拆成四层：科学设计、工程门禁、证据身份和对外表达。每一层都有可追溯的证据，也都有明确的停止条件。', 'We treat experimental quality as four layers: scientific design, engineering gates, evidence identity, and communication. Each layer has traceable evidence and explicit stop conditions.')}</p>
      <dl class="quality-layers">
        <div><dt>{t('科学设计', 'Scientific design')}</dt><dd><strong>{t('先冻结再运行', 'Freeze before execution')}</strong><p>{t('任务、seed、预算、final panel、唯一 treatment 都在执行前定义；历史结果不能事后改名成新实验。', 'Tasks, seeds, budget, final panel, and the sole treatment are defined before execution; historical results cannot be relabeled post hoc as a new experiment.')}</p></dd></div>
        <div><dt>{t('工程门禁', 'Engineering gates')}</dt><dd><strong>fail closed</strong><p>{t('parser、存储、GPU 身份、确定性、Ray 资源和写权限任一层不满足，实验保持 HOLD，而不是靠“应该没事”继续。', 'Parser, storage, GPU identity, determinism, Ray resources, or write permissions can independently hold an experiment instead of relying on “it should be fine.”')}</p></dd></div>
        <div><dt>{t('证据身份', 'Evidence identity')}</dt><dd><strong>SHA / manifest / receipt</strong><p>{t('代码版本、模型状态、轨迹、远端归档都用不可变身份核对；“上传成功”不等于“能恢复”，还要 fresh read / hash verification。', 'Code versions, model states, trajectories, and remote archives are checked with immutable identities; “uploaded” is not “recoverable” without fresh readback / hash verification.')}</p></dd></div>
        <div><dt>{t('对外表达', 'Communication')}</dt><dd><strong>{t('结论与边界一起展示', 'Claim and boundary together')}</strong><p>{t('BaseModel 首屏只抓一个重点，同时把会改变科学解释的 caveat 放在可见层；中英文、明暗主题、移动端进入浏览器验收。', 'BaseModel keeps one first-screen focus while interpretation-changing caveats remain visible; both locales, themes, and mobile layouts enter browser acceptance.')}</p></dd></div>
      </dl>
      <footer class="slide-footer"><a href={flowHref}>{t('查看完整流程理解图 ↗', 'Open the full flow map ↗')}</a><a href="#pace">{t('下一页：推进节奏 ↓', 'Next: pace ↓')}</a></footer>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="pace" class="briefing-slide" aria-labelledby="pace-title">
    <div class="slide-inner">
      <p class="slide-number">09 / 10</p>
      <h2 id="pace-title">{t('推进节奏', 'Pace')}</h2>
      <p class="slide-thesis">{t('追求的速度不是“把一个错误实验更快跑完”，而是让发现问题 → 定位原因 → 固化规则 → 启动下一轮的周期越来越短。', 'The speed we care about is not finishing a flawed experiment faster. It is shortening the cycle from finding a problem, to isolating its cause, encoding a guardrail, and launching the next valid experiment.')}</p>
      <ol class="date-line">
        <li><time datetime="2026-08-25">08-25</time><div><strong>{t('测量链修复', 'Measurement repaired')}</strong><p>{t('把 wrapper/parser 误差与模型表现分开，得到可解释的 7.17 vs 8.74 配对测量。', 'Separated wrapper/parser error from model performance, producing an interpretable 7.17 vs 8.74 paired measurement.')}</p></div></li>
        <li><time datetime="2026-08-31">08-31</time><div><strong>{t('7B Ceiling 长周期运行', '7B Ceiling long-horizon run')}</strong><p>{t('从短批次诊断推进到持续参数学习，并保留每轮可追溯状态。', 'Moved from short-batch diagnostics to sustained parameter learning with traceable per-round state.')}</p></div></li>
        <li><time datetime="2026-09-05">09-05</time><div><strong>7B final closeout</strong><p>149 rounds · 19,072 rollouts · 49.33 / 100 · 58 / 128 exact</p></div></li>
        <li><time datetime="2026-09-06">09-06</time><div><strong>{t('Q17 双胞胎机制实验', 'Q17 mechanism twin')}</strong><p>{t('把 GDR vs DirectApply 写成只允许一个 treatment variable 的预注册执行合同。', 'Froze GDR vs DirectApply as a preregistered execution contract with one intended treatment variable.')}</p></div></li>
        <li><time datetime="2026-09-07">09-07</time><div><strong>{t('发现确定性污染并暂停', 'Determinism contamination found; experiment paused')}</strong><p>{t('同 GPU 仍复现候选权重漂移，Round 1 不继续；问题升级为 OpenEvo Core issue #13。', 'Candidate-weight drift reproduced even on the same GPU, Round 1 was held, and the root issue was isolated as OpenEvo Core issue #13.')}</p></div></li>
        <li><time datetime="2026-09-08">09-08</time><div><strong>{t('进展变成可讲、可查的汇报页', 'Turn progress into an auditable briefing')}</strong><p>{t('老师先听懂主线，同时保留数字、哈希、实验边界与来源链接。', 'Give advisors the main story first while keeping exact numbers, hashes, experimental boundaries, and source links available.')}</p></div></li>
      </ol>
      <footer class="slide-footer"><span>{t('速度 = 更短的有效研究闭环，而不是更高的 GPU 利用率。', 'Speed = a shorter valid research loop, not higher GPU utilization.')}</span><a href="#next">{t('下一页：下一步 ↓', 'Next ↓')}</a></footer>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="next" class="briefing-slide briefing-final" aria-labelledby="next-title">
    <div class="slide-inner">
      <p class="slide-number">10 / 10</p>
      <h2 id="next-title">{t('下一步', 'Next steps')}</h2>
      <p class="slide-thesis">{t('下一步分三层推进：先修好确定性底座，再恢复机制对照，最后收口 OpenEVO vs SEED 主 benchmark。', 'The next phase has three layers: repair determinism first, resume the mechanism twin, then close the OpenEVO-vs-SEED main benchmark.')}</p>
      <ol class="next-steps">
        <li><span>1</span><div><strong>{t('固定 GPU 确定性资格', 'Qualify fixed-GPU determinism')}</strong><p>{t('实验仍暂停；同 payload / seed / physical GPU 的 SD-LoRA 重复必须产生相同 adapter SHA、state hash 与 loss。', 'Experiments remain paused; repeated SD-LoRA training with the same payload / seed / physical GPU must reproduce adapter SHA, state hashes, and loss.')}</p></div></li>
        <li><span>2</span><div><strong>{t('干净重启 Q17', 'Start a clean Q17 successor')}</strong><p>{t('新 successor 不复用受污染的 formal Round0 作为新科学数据；重做 Round0 parity，并等待明确 resume authority。算法层结论至少 3 个训练 seed。', 'The clean successor will not reuse contaminated formal Round0 as new science; Round0 parity is rebuilt and explicit resume authority is required. Algorithm-level conclusions require at least three training seeds.')}</p></div></li>
        <li><span>3</span><div><strong>{t('收口 OpenEVO vs SEED 主 benchmark', 'Close the OpenEVO-vs-SEED main benchmark')}</strong><p>{t('同一任务、同一评测规则、匹配任务预算，final panel 锁到训练结束；机制实验只负责解释差异，不能替代最终比较。', 'Use the same tasks, evaluation rules, and matched task budget, with the final panel locked until training ends. Mechanism studies explain differences; they do not replace the final comparison.')}</p></div></li>
      </ol>
      <div class="advisor-question">
        <p>{t('希望魏老师和学长帮我判断的一件事', 'One priority question for the advisor and senior lab members')}</p>
        <h3>{t('确定性底座修好以后，研究优先级应更偏向“尽快收口 OpenEVO vs SEED 最终效果”，还是先把“GDR 为什么挡掉更新”机制做得更深？', 'After the determinism substrate is fixed, should we prioritize closing the OpenEVO-vs-SEED final effect sooner, or go deeper on why GDR rejects updates first?')}</h3>
        <span>{t('我的当前顺序：确定性必须先修；之后主 benchmark 与机制研究可以并行，但不共享会污染 treatment 的状态。', 'My current ordering: determinism first; then the main benchmark and mechanism study may proceed in parallel without sharing state that contaminates the treatment.')}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="final-links"><a href={q17Successor} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><ExternalBrandMark href={q17Successor} />Q17 clean successor ↗</a><a href={resultsHref}>{t('研究结果 ↗', 'Research findings ↗')}</a><a href="#briefing-top">{t('回到开头 ↑', 'Back to start ↑')}</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</article>

